# How each part of a mechanism can move (F9, degrees of freedom
# analysis): the four-bar's crank and rocker each turn about their pin
# on the ground, a fixed axis, and the coupler about an axis that moves
# with the linkage, as the link screens say. The same four-bar closed by
# a hinge in place of the point on a line (fourbar_hinged.tlspr), which
# says again what the loop holds already, still solves, the hinges'
# constraints marked implied, the rocker turning about the same pin.
file $testdata/ui/mechanism/fourbar.tlspr
menu File|Open...
click-tw g004-crank
tw
click-tw home
click-tw g005-coupler
tw
click-tw home
click-tw g006-rocker
tw
file $testdata/ui/mechanism/fourbar_hinged.tlspr
menu File|Open...
click-tw g006-rocker
tw
